Initialization
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
System Construction
lattice bcc 3.3006
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
region target block 0 20 0 20 20 60 units lattice
region full union 2 projectile target
create_box 1 full
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 1 region target
Potential
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
Miscellaneous
mass 1 92.906
group projectile region projectile
group target region target
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
velocity projectile set NULL NULL 2 units box
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix 1 all nve
fix 2 all temp/rescale 1 300 300 0 1
run 50000
unfix 2
Production Run
run 200000
